NGINX (pronounced "engine-x"):
===============================
It is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy server. In a typical React + Spring Boot application, NGINX can sit between the client and your backend/frontend and handle incoming HTTP/HTTPS requests.
A simple architecture is: 
User / Browser
                   |
                   | HTTP / HTTPS  
                   ↓
              +---------+
              |  NGINX  |
              +---------+
               /       \
              /         \
             ↓           ↓
       React Frontend   Spring Boot
       Static Files       Backend
                          |
                          ↓
                       MySQL
